1. Import the tool        → from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression
2. Create the tool        → model = LinearRegression()
3. Feed it your data      → model.fit(X_train, y_train)
4. Ask it to predict      → model.predict(X_test)
5. Check how good it is   → r2_score, MAE, RMSE
6. Save it                → joblib.dump(model, 'model_linear.pkl')